    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p20_b17",
      "text": "Due to space constraints, these results were omitted from the main text. Table 16 presents the combined results for both the\nbaselines and our ablation settings. Second, we report the average output length of the models on the 100 samples used for\nour human evaluation, as shown in Table 17.\n",
