    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p20_b23",
      "text": "To further evaluate the effectiveness of our approach, we extend our evaluation to compare against recent state-of-the-art\ntraining-free baselines designed to mitigate hallucinations in Large Vision-Language Models (LVLMs). These include\nVCD (Leng et al., 2024), OPERA (Huang et al., 2024b), and VISTA (Li et al., 2025).\n",
